"Grand Bal Plissé Soleil" = "Grand Bal Plissé Soleil 腕表";
"The Grand Bal Plissé Soleil automatic watch features a mesmerizing oscillating weight inspired by Dior Haute Couture. Crafted in steel and gold with a mother-of-pearl dial, this 36mm masterpiece embodies the art of movement." = "Grand Bal Plissé Soleil 自动腕表配备了从 Dior 高级定制时装中汲取灵感的迷人摆陀。这款 36 毫米杰作采用精钢和黄金打造，配以珍珠母贝表盘，彰显动感艺术。";
"Rose des Vents Bracelet" = "Rose des Vents 手链";
"The Rose des Vents bracelet, a Victoire de Castellane creation, features the Maison's lucky star set in 18K yellow gold with turquoise and a diamond. A contemporary talisman inspired by Christian Dior's love of the stars." = "Rose des Vents 手链是 Victoire de Castellane 的作品，采用 18K 黄金镶嵌绿松石和钻石，展现了品牌标志性的幸运星。这是一件从克里斯汀·迪奥对星星的热爱中汲取灵感的现代护身符。";
"Oblique Jacquard Jacket" = "Oblique 提花夹克";
"This iconic Dior Oblique jacquard jacket features the signature monogram motif reimagined by Kim Jones. Crafted from technical cotton blend with a relaxed silhouette. A modern wardrobe essential from the Maison." = "这款标志性的 Dior Oblique 提花夹克采用 Kim Jones 重新构想的标志性字母组合图案。由科技棉混纺制成，廓形休闲。来自该品牌的现代衣橱必备单品。";
"Lady Dior" = "Lady Dior 戴妃包";
"The Lady Dior — an icon since 1995, beloved by Princess Diana. Crafted in supple cannage lambskin with gold-tone D.I.O.R. charms. The quilted motif is inspired by the Napoleon III chairs Christian Dior loved." = "Lady Dior 戴妃包 — 自 1995 年以来的标志，深受戴安娜王妃的喜爱。采用柔软的藤格纹小羊皮制成，配有金色 D.I.O.R. 吊饰。绗缝图案的灵感来自克里斯汀·迪奥钟爱的拿破仑三世椅子。";
"B23 High-Top Sneakers" = "B23 高帮运动鞋";
"The B23 high-top sneaker features the Dior Oblique motif on transparent technical canvas. With a white rubber sole and calfskin details, it's a contemporary icon that bridges streetwear and haute couture." = "B23 高帮运动鞋在透明科技帆布上呈现 Dior Oblique 图案。搭配白色橡胶鞋底和牛皮革细节，这是连接街头服饰和高级定制时装的现代标志。";
"Sauvage Elixir" = "旷野男士淬炼香精";
"Sauvage Elixir is the most concentrated expression of the iconic Sauvage line. A rich elixir of spices, woods, and amber notes by François Demachy. A fragrance of raw, noble elegance for the modern man." = "旷野男士淬炼香精是标志性旷野系列中浓度最高的一款。由 François Demachy 调制的充满香料、木质和琥珀香调的浓郁淬炼精粹。一款专为现代男士打造的充满原始高贵优雅气息的香水。";
"DiorBlackSuit Sunglasses" = "DiorBlackSuit 太阳眼镜";
"The DiorBlackSuit navigator sunglasses feature the CD Diamond signature on the temples. Crafted in lightweight metal with grey gradient lenses. A refined silhouette embodying Dior's timeless Parisian elegance." = "DiorBlackSuit 飞行员太阳眼镜在镜腿上饰有 CD Diamond 标志。由轻质金属制成，配有灰色渐变镜片。精致的轮廓体现了迪奥永恒的巴黎优雅风情。";

